! THE FOREARM and the three relays that ride the elbow axis. Same idea one link further out: the
! coupler from a shoulder relay is parallel to the upper arm and the two cranks are equal, so it is
! a parallelogram and the elbow relay holds its attitude when the shoulder moves.
